{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"In circle time, the teacher shares a talking shell.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.26,0.66],[0.71,1.1],[1.13,1.22],[1.29,1.64],[1.7,2.06],[2.11,2.16],[2.24,2.68],[2.77,3.58]]},{"text":"Only the child holding the shell speaks.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.37,0.44],[0.51,0.92],[1,1.37],[1.43,1.5],[1.57,1.88],[1.96,2.55]]},{"text":"When Leo talks, Mina keeps her eyes on him and listens.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.35,0.61],[0.7,1.13],[1.21,1.49],[1.56,1.86],[1.92,2.03],[2.11,2.33],[2.39,2.51],[2.59,2.75],[2.82,2.94],[3.02,3.95]]},{"text":"Mina wants to speak too, but she waits for her turn.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.38,0.65],[0.7,0.79],[0.86,1.18],[1.26,1.67],[1.88,2.08],[2.14,2.26],[2.33,2.6],[2.66,2.81],[2.88,3.02],[3.1,3.95]]},{"text":"When she gets the shell, she speaks clearly and kindly.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.43],[0.5,0.73],[0.79,0.86],[0.94,1.37],[1.42,1.54],[1.6,1.97],[2.07,2.53],[2.59,2.71],[2.8,3.76]]},{"text":"Leo says, So you felt proud when you finished your puzzle?","words":[[0,0.37],[0.46,1.02],[1.31,1.47],[1.54,1.64],[1.73,2],[2.08,2.46],[2.52,2.68],[2.73,2.8],[2.88,3.27],[3.3,3.46],[3.54,4.41]]},{"text":"Mina nods. Leo repeated her idea to show he understood.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.43,1.02],[1.31,1.57],[1.65,2.13],[2.19,2.33],[2.42,2.8],[2.88,2.97],[3.04,3.29],[3.35,3.45],[3.53,4.64]]},{"text":"At recess, they use kind words to solve who goes first on the slide.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.29,0.94],[1,1.21],[1.29,1.49],[1.56,1.88],[1.95,2.31],[2.37,2.46],[2.55,2.89],[2.94,3.12],[3.2,3.48],[3.59,3.97],[4.04,4.16],[4.2,4.27],[4.33,5.25]]},{"text":"Everyone gets a turn to talk and a turn to play.","words":[[0,0.65],[0.71,0.94],[0.99,1.03],[1.09,1.37],[1.43,1.5],[1.58,1.93],[2,2.11],[2.17,2.22],[2.29,2.6],[2.66,2.73],[2.81,3.62]]},{"text":"The class learns listening and kind words make friendship stronger.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.24,0.63],[0.71,1.13],[1.26,1.83],[1.97,2.22],[2.36,2.74],[2.81,3.23],[3.31,3.54],[3.61,4.17],[4.24,5.25]]}]}